WEBVTT

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:06.530
Hey, you there.

00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:12.780
Hey. That was a good stenka you put on.

00:00:17.210 --> 00:00:21.660
You're a big guy, to be Japanese.
I can tell even under all those clothes.

00:00:21.660 --> 00:00:23.870
You a stenka fighter, too?

00:00:23.870 --> 00:00:25.310
I'm Sugimoto Saichi.

00:00:28.830 --> 00:00:31.210
My name is Gansoku Maiharu.

00:00:31.210 --> 00:00:34.340
It's rare for a Japanese man
to offer a handshake.

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:44.600
Sugimoto-san, I'll see you again very soon.

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.010
There you are.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:54.740
Who was that? What were you talking about?

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:55.730
Nothing.

00:01:20.390 --> 00:01:26.830
<b>Golden Kamuy</b>

00:02:31.460 --> 00:02:34.380
The story of the Japanese 
soldiers spread quickly.

00:02:34.380 --> 00:02:38.410
The rumors say they could even 
beat the man with the tattoos.

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:40.650
<b>Episode Twenty-Six
Stenka</b>

00:02:39.030 --> 00:02:41.510
He'll be at the stenka tonight.

00:02:41.510 --> 00:02:44.260
Many will bet on you.

00:02:44.260 --> 00:02:48.450
"If you lose deliberately, I can 
win a lot of money," he says.

00:02:48.450 --> 00:02:51.270
What about the deal to give back our dog?

00:02:53.310 --> 00:02:56.030
You can have it back after 
the fixed match is over.

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:03.300
Some Ainu have a punishment where they 
slice off a person's nose or ears.

00:03:03.300 --> 00:03:05.700
Do the Karafuto Ainu have that, Enonoka?

00:03:05.700 --> 00:03:07.450
We cut off their fingertips!

00:03:09.890 --> 00:03:14.380
He says he'll tell the man with 
that tattoos that we're after him.

00:03:14.380 --> 00:03:16.770
You picked the wrong guys 
to play hardball with.

00:03:17.420 --> 00:03:18.970
Listen up, everyone.

00:03:18.970 --> 00:03:21.420
We'll go over the plan.

00:03:21.990 --> 00:03:25.120
Sgt. Tsukishima, tell him, too.

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:28.530
First, we slice off one finger at 
a time until he gives back the dog.

00:03:29.340 --> 00:03:31.310
Then, when we're done burying 
him in the back yard,

00:03:31.310 --> 00:03:35.230
we go to the stenka and find 
the man with the tattoos.

00:03:36.120 --> 00:03:37.290
We don't do the stenka.

00:03:37.290 --> 00:03:40.590
We kidnap the man and take him to 
the forest, where we shoot him.

00:03:49.180 --> 00:03:53.040
I've got information on the man 
in the photo I haven't told you yet!

00:03:53.040 --> 00:03:57.230
You've got more info on him?
 You know where he is?

00:03:57.230 --> 00:03:58.860
We start with the index finger.

00:03:59.320 --> 00:04:00.650
Hold his hand, Tsukishima.

00:04:00.650 --> 00:04:04.650
Wait. He may actually know something.

00:04:05.410 --> 00:04:09.350
He's obviously lying so we don't kill him.

00:04:09.350 --> 00:04:10.790
I agree.

00:04:10.790 --> 00:04:12.510
Not a word he says can be trusted.

00:04:12.510 --> 00:04:17.730
Getting caught up in more stenka bets 
because of him is a waste of time and effort.

00:04:17.730 --> 00:04:19.580
This isn't like you.

00:04:19.580 --> 00:04:21.940
You're usually smarter than this.

00:04:22.710 --> 00:04:24.260
I'm sorry, Enonoka-chan.

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:26.450
But...

00:04:27.500 --> 00:04:30.950
If there's even the slightest chance 
it'll lead us to Asirpa-san,

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:33.140
I can't waste that possibility.

00:04:37.610 --> 00:04:40.170
We've been waiting for this!

00:04:39.410 --> 00:04:41.830
I bet a lot of money on you, Japanese!

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:44.160
Win for me, soldiers!

00:04:47.790 --> 00:04:49.570
<i>The code tattoos!</i>

00:04:50.660 --> 00:05:00.520
<b>What is Stenka to you?</b>

00:04:53.700 --> 00:04:55.480
A method of self-expression.

00:04:55.480 --> 00:05:00.520
No different than expressing oneself 
with dance, words, or painting.

00:05:01.150 --> 00:05:04.600
I'll punch anyone with this fist.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:11.090
The one way I always chose since I was a 
child for others to know me was violence.

00:05:11.670 --> 00:05:14.710
But nobody liked me...

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:19.750
The world didn't understand me.

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:23.990
I spent most of my life in prison.

00:05:24.960 --> 00:05:29.200
But I enjoyed my time in prison.

00:05:29.670 --> 00:05:32.020
The prisons were filled with violence.

00:05:32.020 --> 00:05:35.240
Everyone rejoiced when I punched a guard.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:38.620
And I met the most wonderful people...

00:05:38.620 --> 00:05:42.320
Only Ushiyama-san had the strength 
to stop me with bare hands.

00:05:42.320 --> 00:05:44.720
Once you grab someone in judo, it's over.

00:05:46.140 --> 00:05:49.940
As a reward, did they give 
him a woman, perhaps?

00:05:49.940 --> 00:05:54.750
Any time I was out of control, Warden Inudou
 would send Ushiyama-san after me.

00:05:55.490 --> 00:05:58.650
I was happy to get the chance to fight him.

00:05:58.650 --> 00:06:02.500
Sometimes, when it was 
just punching, I managed to beat him!

00:06:03.850 --> 00:06:08.810
The moment I heard those cheers was 
the moment I felt accepted by society!

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:14.770
It's that man from before!

00:06:15.480 --> 00:06:18.060
Did you notice he was a tattooed prisoner?

00:06:18.730 --> 00:06:23.200
You didn't say a word because you 
wanted to face him in the stenka, right?

00:06:23.200 --> 00:06:25.220
Then what about the fixed match?

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:28.830
Looks like you've no 
intention at all of losing.

00:06:29.310 --> 00:06:32.410
If you win, that small 
possibility you had goes away.

00:06:33.260 --> 00:06:36.600
We'll get back the dog and get 
the information on Asirpa-san.

00:06:37.340 --> 00:06:40.890
I've got a plan in my head 
to make it at all work out.

00:06:40.890 --> 00:06:42.540
So fight as hard as you can!

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:48.130
It's that talky Russian!

00:06:48.480 --> 00:06:51.350
It doesn't make sense that he's not 
at the stenka. He's one of them!

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:53.480
He's watching the dog.

00:06:53.480 --> 00:06:55.760
Let's get it back on our own!

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:02.170
Ready!

00:07:02.920 --> 00:07:03.790
Punch!

00:07:07.130 --> 00:07:12.240
Tell me more about yourself, Sugimoto-san!

00:07:23.670 --> 00:07:25.600
Yes! Yes! Yes!

00:07:25.600 --> 00:07:27.900
Yes, Sugimoto-san!

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:49.740
Hey! Look at me!

00:07:49.740 --> 00:07:52.280
Look at me! Look at me! Look at me!

00:07:52.280 --> 00:07:54.680
Look at me! Look at me! Look at me!

00:07:54.890 --> 00:07:57.020
Look at me!

00:08:00.470 --> 00:08:02.040
You okay, Sugimoto?

00:08:02.730 --> 00:08:06.540
I... I... I...

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:13.610
They all went down except for 
the man with the tattoos!

00:08:13.610 --> 00:08:15.560
Get 'em, Japanese!

00:08:16.510 --> 00:08:19.470
Please, all four of you at once, attack me!

00:08:20.370 --> 00:08:21.730
Bastard!

00:08:24.060 --> 00:08:26.060
More! More!

00:08:26.060 --> 00:08:29.570
<i>More</i>!

00:08:35.210 --> 00:08:38.110
He's strong... He's too strong.

00:08:38.110 --> 00:08:41.070
I... I...

00:08:42.000 --> 00:08:45.540
Well? This is me.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.050
That's cheating!

00:08:54.050 --> 00:08:56.320
We bet money on you!

00:08:57.050 --> 00:08:59.260
Sugimoto, what are you doing?

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:04.600
I get it, Sugimoto! This is your plan!

00:09:06.350 --> 00:09:07.870
Calm down, Sugimoto!

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:10.610
Get him!

00:09:19.230 --> 00:09:22.220
I'm Immortal Sugimoto!

00:09:22.220 --> 00:09:24.800
This is real stenka!

00:09:24.800 --> 00:09:31.480
There's more to stenka than 
just watching a brawl!

00:09:31.480 --> 00:09:33.880
This is the real thing!

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:35.540
I...

00:09:36.980 --> 00:09:40.160
Sugimoto, this is really your plan, right?

00:09:45.610 --> 00:09:46.730
Sugimoto?

00:09:47.690 --> 00:09:50.690
The 7th Division...

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:53.820
Lieutenant Koito, this isn't a plan!

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:55.690
He just took too many hits to the head!

00:10:00.340 --> 00:10:02.120
This is not stenka!

00:10:04.770 --> 00:10:07.440
Gold...

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:12.190
You were only after my tattoos?

00:10:12.190 --> 00:10:13.590
That's so mean!

00:10:13.590 --> 00:10:14.590
The cat's out of the bag!

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:17.970
I thought we could understand each other!

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:25.140
<i>The unfortunate monster, Gansoku...</i>

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:29.770
Where'd the prisoner go?

00:10:30.200 --> 00:10:32.010
There! Follow him!

00:10:32.810 --> 00:10:35.540
What about Sugimoto, Sergeant Tsukishima?

00:10:35.540 --> 00:10:37.130
He's dangerous, so leave him!

00:10:37.130 --> 00:10:39.070
Just go after the prisoner!

00:10:44.080 --> 00:10:46.470
They followed me all the way to Karafuto?

00:10:46.470 --> 00:10:48.630
I can't stay here anymore.

00:10:55.120 --> 00:10:56.400
Where'd he go?

00:10:56.400 --> 00:10:57.800
Follow the footsteps!

00:10:57.800 --> 00:10:59.220
It's too dark to see.

00:10:59.220 --> 00:11:00.590
And it's cold.

00:11:04.770 --> 00:11:07.720
Let me go!

00:11:07.720 --> 00:11:08.860
That's him!

00:11:08.860 --> 00:11:09.980
A wolverine's got him!

00:11:10.210 --> 00:11:12.430
Lieutenant Tsukishima, do you have a gun?

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:13.960
Do I look like I do?

00:11:13.960 --> 00:11:15.860
We have to help him, or it'll eat the tattoos!

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:28.700
Run! We can't beat that thing with stenka!

00:11:32.710 --> 00:11:33.510
A shack!

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:35.360
Keep running! It'll catch up!

00:11:45.390 --> 00:11:46.300
It's hot!

00:11:46.780 --> 00:11:48.790
Why is it so hot?

00:11:48.790 --> 00:11:51.900
This is a Russian steam bath!

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:53.150
A banya!

00:11:53.150 --> 00:11:54.440
It's too hot!

00:11:54.440 --> 00:11:56.150
We can't stay here long!

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:58.650
But the wolverine's outside!

00:11:59.300 --> 00:12:00.400
What do we do?

00:12:02.050 --> 00:12:03.660
Think, everyone!

00:12:04.450 --> 00:12:07.180
It's hot! It's so hot!

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:08.950
It's so hot!

00:12:10.780 --> 00:12:12.850
<i>Banya!</i>

00:12:14.390 --> 00:12:17.040
<b>Golden Kamuy</b>

00:12:32.280 --> 00:12:33.230
It's locked!

00:12:33.700 --> 00:12:34.600
What do we do?

00:12:37.000 --> 00:12:39.660
Shoot it with Tanigaki Nispa's gun.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:41.990
No! It'll be too loud!

00:12:43.740 --> 00:12:46.450
The wolverine's not going away.

00:12:46.810 --> 00:12:48.920
Is there anything we can use as a weapon?

00:12:48.920 --> 00:12:50.310
It's so hot...

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:52.960
We have to do something about Sugimoto, too.

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:56.260
We have to regroup here...

00:12:56.690 --> 00:12:58.040
But it's so hot...

00:13:00.420 --> 00:13:01.820
Hey, you!

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:03.590
Don't make steam!

00:13:06.010 --> 00:13:07.520
It's so hot!

00:13:08.350 --> 00:13:12.350
This is a venik. It's a 
bunch of white birch leaves.

00:13:13.270 --> 00:13:15.130
Ow! Ow!

00:13:16.020 --> 00:13:19.820
Being struck with a venik 
stimulates blood flow,

00:13:19.820 --> 00:13:24.100
and by stirring up the air in 
the room, it also makes it feel hotter!

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:27.080
Stop it! There's a wolverine outside!

00:13:27.080 --> 00:13:31.300
You're here to kill me and 
strip my tattoos, right?

00:13:31.300 --> 00:13:36.040
Now, let's see who gives in and 
runs out of the banya first!

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:43.880
I want you to all strike me at once!

00:13:57.780 --> 00:13:59.050
Further left.

00:14:01.090 --> 00:14:03.710
That's right! No! No!

00:14:04.900 --> 00:14:06.070
There!

00:14:06.810 --> 00:14:09.320
Go... No!

00:14:11.030 --> 00:14:12.890
You!

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:14.640
Wait!

00:14:21.820 --> 00:14:22.920
Yes!

00:14:25.460 --> 00:14:26.920
I'm shooting, Enonoka.

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:38.880
More!

00:14:39.880 --> 00:14:42.560
More! More!

00:14:41.520 --> 00:14:43.990
<i>What am I doing?</i>

00:14:43.990 --> 00:14:48.390
More! More!

00:14:48.390 --> 00:14:51.920
This is all part of Sugimoto's plan, right?

00:14:51.920 --> 00:14:53.780
I'm sure that it's not!

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:01.550
Hooray!

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:03.390
We got it back ourselves!

00:15:07.480 --> 00:15:09.340
Sugimoto Nispa?

00:15:10.560 --> 00:15:11.850
He's acting weird...

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:13.850
Don't stop!

00:15:14.100 --> 00:15:16.650
He's gone crazy!

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:24.370
Go! Go!

00:15:32.110 --> 00:15:33.510
Cikapasi!

00:15:41.720 --> 00:15:43.930
Go away!

00:15:44.720 --> 00:15:46.040
Ryu!

00:16:14.860 --> 00:16:16.310
Tanigaki Nispa!

00:16:16.310 --> 00:16:19.370
One shot! You've got one shot, so make it count!

00:16:20.870 --> 00:16:23.220
Pull the trigger, Cikapasi!

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:34.840
Is this...

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:37.040
Is this... a boner?

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:39.140
Yes, Cikapasi!

00:16:39.490 --> 00:16:40.900
This is a boner!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:49.600
I want to finish things with you.

00:16:58.610 --> 00:17:02.540
<i>Sugimoto-san's fists contain rage.</i>

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.930
<i>But he should feel no anger toward me.</i>

00:17:07.730 --> 00:17:09.090
Should we help?

00:17:09.320 --> 00:17:11.240
Help who?

00:17:11.240 --> 00:17:13.120
We need to stop them.

00:17:13.120 --> 00:17:15.620
We need Sugimoto to get Asirpa back.

00:17:15.620 --> 00:17:17.140
We can't let him take any more hits!

00:17:18.450 --> 00:17:21.190
Why do you feel such anger?

00:17:25.230 --> 00:17:27.010
Who are you angry at?

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:30.070
What are you angry at?

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:38.320
As... Asirpa-san!

00:17:41.290 --> 00:17:42.350
I...

00:17:44.010 --> 00:17:45.010
I...

00:17:49.500 --> 00:17:50.440
I...

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:54.880
I...

00:17:55.210 --> 00:17:56.840
I'm useless!

00:17:59.760 --> 00:18:01.500
Forgive yourself.

00:18:01.500 --> 00:18:03.410
You're working so hard...

00:18:03.410 --> 00:18:05.750
You're a mess now!

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:16.860
That's enough! Stop!

00:18:30.290 --> 00:18:31.900
It's so cold!

00:18:34.150 --> 00:18:36.450
It's so cold!

00:18:36.450 --> 00:18:38.320
Back to the banya!

00:18:38.830 --> 00:18:40.490
Tsukishima!

00:18:40.490 --> 00:18:42.360
I didn't realize we were on the ice.

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:45.830
You killed a kuciri!

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:47.100
You were so cool!

00:18:47.510 --> 00:18:50.960
Well, Tanigaki Nispa helped me.

00:18:50.960 --> 00:18:53.770
Yup. You had your eyes closed.

00:18:58.630 --> 00:19:02.490
So what was your plan, exactly?

00:19:03.380 --> 00:19:04.620
I forget.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.310
Shall we continue?

00:19:07.310 --> 00:19:10.080
If you still want my tattoos.

00:19:11.100 --> 00:19:12.800
I don't want to kill you.

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:15.910
But somebody will come after the tattoos.

00:19:15.910 --> 00:19:18.840
You may be a great brawler, 
but you can't beat a gun.

00:19:20.560 --> 00:19:24.850
Let us copy the tattoos, 
and we'll find the gold.

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:29.120
And then nobody else will want them anymore.

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:32.360
Leave Karafuto. Go as far west as you can.

00:19:32.360 --> 00:19:34.940
Go to the other end of the continent 
and nobody will follow you.

00:19:35.750 --> 00:19:38.020
Pursue stenka in its birthplace, Russia.

00:19:40.080 --> 00:19:44.120
I guess I'll have to find someone stronger.

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:48.080
Stop with the steam!

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:51.950
Oh, and that name Sugimoto-san was saying...

00:19:52.420 --> 00:19:53.460
Was I saying something?

00:19:54.100 --> 00:19:55.710
Asir...

00:19:55.710 --> 00:19:57.630
You know Asirpa-san?

00:19:58.450 --> 00:20:01.360
Yes, Asirpa.

00:20:01.360 --> 00:20:03.050
An Ainu girl.

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:08.850
I remember that name because the man 
she was with had tattoos, like me.

00:20:08.850 --> 00:20:09.990
Shiraishi!

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:14.280
I followed him to the tavern 
because I wondered what could've

00:20:14.280 --> 00:20:17.360
brought him all the way to Karafuto.

00:20:17.890 --> 00:20:20.320
What was she talking about?

00:20:20.760 --> 00:20:24.490
Probably about you, Sugimoto-san.

00:20:26.040 --> 00:20:28.740
<i>I can't see him dying.</i>

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:31.460
I said that, sure, but...

00:20:32.170 --> 00:20:33.120
What?

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:38.840
If he didn't follow us up here, then maybe...

00:20:38.840 --> 00:20:40.530
What are you saying, Shiraishi?

00:20:41.800 --> 00:20:43.970
He's Immortal Sugimoto!

00:21:03.280 --> 00:21:05.370
A wounded one went that way!

00:22:44.690 --> 00:22:48.410
Sea lions go north of Karafuto 
to breed in the summer,

00:22:48.410 --> 00:22:51.540
and then head south to Hokkaido 
for the winter at this time of year.

00:22:51.540 --> 00:22:54.390
This one might've been doing just that.

00:22:54.390 --> 00:22:56.520
We call them etaspe.

00:22:57.200 --> 00:23:01.270
Their fatty meat is a delicacy. Try some.

00:23:07.930 --> 00:23:10.650
You can't chew through it? 
Maybe it was too thick.

00:23:11.240 --> 00:23:12.390
Is it hinna?

00:23:12.810 --> 00:23:15.030
It's very stinky.

00:23:16.290 --> 00:23:20.100
I know I hit it in the head,
but it didn't go down.

00:23:20.100 --> 00:23:23.420
It's like a bear. The bone 
on the head is strong.

00:23:24.010 --> 00:23:27.560
When you're fighting a tough one,
 don't aim for the head.

00:23:28.870 --> 00:23:32.300
Asirpa-chan, you ate too much fat.

00:23:35.370 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Next Time
Igogusa</b>

00:23:36.770 --> 00:23:40.020
Next Time: "Igogusa"!
